---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Teams
description: "RKC Third Coast FC's three senior teams: USL League Two, USL W League and the Midwest Premier League."
permalink: /teams/
---
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section__head">
      <div class="stack">
        <h1>Teams</h1>
        <p class="match__venue">Three teams. One club, one home ground in Racine.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid--3">
      {%- for t in teams %}
      <a class="team-card" href="/teams/{{ t.code }}/"><span class="label label--quiet">{{ t.league }}</span><span class="team-card__name">{{ t.code | rkcName }}</span><span class="label">Meet the Squad</span></a>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section section--mist" aria-labelledby="play-h">
  <div class="wrap stack">
    <h2 id="play-h">Want to play here?</h2>
    <p class="prose">Fill in the player interest form and the coaches will reach out if there's a fit.</p>
    <div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn--primary" href="/play/">Player Interest Form</a></div>
  </div>
</section>
